        <item>
            <title>1.2.6</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 16:41:02 -0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>9</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2.6</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Overhead 1.2.6</h3><ul>
<li>Airline flights now show their route up front — origin, destination, and city names</li>
<li>A progress bar shows how far along the flight is and how far it has left to go</li>
<li>Photo credits are now readable, and clicking a photo opens it on Planespotters</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
